~ start_kai
do hide_portrait_for("Ab")
Kai: This one time Cecil and I were playing together with some paper swords. [ID:THIS_ONE_TIME_CECIL_AND_I_WERE_46E9FB]
Kai: Which of course we were not supposed to do. [ID:WHICH_OF_COURSE_WE_WERE_NOT_SU_669237]
Kai: we were playing on the living room,  jumping from couch to couch. [ID:WE_WERE_PLAYING_ON_THE_LIVING_9DB1EA]
Kai: Which of course we were also not supposed to do. [ID:WHICH_OF_COURSE_WE_WERE_ALSO_N_742CA6]
Kai: anyways, we were in the heat of battle right? [ID:ANYWAYS_WE_WERE_IN_THE_HEAT_OF_3F48D5]
Kai: And Cecil had the upper hand. [ID:AND_CECIL_HAD_THE_UPPER_HAND_458F55]
Kai: So i pulled my ultimate move: the Sword Helicopter 3000. [ID:SO_I_PULLED_MY_ULTIMATE_MOVE_T_3E33E8]
Kai: A devastating atack, it helped me turn the battle. [ID:A_DEVASTATING_ATACK_IT_HELPED_852A45]
Kai: But such a powerful move comes with consecuences. [ID:BUT_SUCH_A_POWERFUL_MOVE_COMES_C81B94]
Kai: the consecuences being: a very expensive lamp and 2 glasses. [ID:THE_CONSECUENCES_BEING_A_VERY_1976DB]
Kai: Since i was the winner, my prize was Cecil not saying anything about it. [ID:SINCE_I_WAS_THE_WINNER_MY_PRIZ_D701CD]
Kai: ... [ID:_BBDEE8]
Kai: Please dont tell this to my dad. [ID:PLEASE_DONT_TELL_THIS_TO_MY_DA_8CBE91]
do call_cutscene_event("ab_knows")
=> END

